    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are pleased to present a detached 3 bedroom cottage with outbuildings on approximately 0.25 hectare / 0.62 acre of mature, landscaped grounds. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a property with undoubted charm wonderfully located in a delightful rustic setting. \nThe property enjoys a generous mature site in a sylvian setting where the country atmosphere is virtually unspoilt, yet it still close to an array of excellent local services including shops, schools, church and a variety of sporting and recreational facilities and is convenient to Prosperous, Clane and larger towns such as Naas, Kildare and Newbridge where all amenities including large retail outlets are available. Dublin city is easily accessible via a frequent nearby bus service and convenience to the M4 and M7 motorways. \nViewing is strongly recommended for those searching for a charming, unique property in a most attractive setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLobby - 1.4m x 1.3m\nWith laminate flooring.\n\nEntrance Hall - 2.7m x 2.0m\nWith tiled flooring, wooden ceiling.\n\nLounge - 5.4m x 4.0m\nWith feature fireplace, oak flooring, coved ceiling, airing cupboard, tv point.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 2.9m x 2.8m\nWith fitted kitchen, electric oven, hob, extractor, integrated fridge/freezer, washing machine, tiled floor tiled splashback, wooden ceiling, recessed lighting, rear door access.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.3m x 2.5m\nTo front with feature fireplace, laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m x 2.8m\nTo side with laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.6m x 2.5m\nTo back with laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.8m x 1.7m\nWith Triton T90sr electric shower, wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled walls, shower screen, wooden ceiling, recessed lighting, mirror front bathroom cabinet.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Constructed 1950, extended 1978</li><li>Floor area 63 sq m approx</li><li>Site 0.62 acre / 0.25 hectare</li><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>Wooden windows</li><li>Blinds, curtains</li><li>Mature grounds</li><li>Den 3.8 x 3.0 </li><li>Deck area</li><li>Boiler house/store 3.3 x 2.1</li><li>Store 5.4 x 2.1</li><li>Spacious lawn.</ul>"
      },
